  "id": "binswangers-disease",
  "term": "Binswanger’s disease",
  "definition": "Binswanger’s disease is a chronic, gradually worsening disorder affecting the brain’s white matter beneath the cortex, linked to widespread small-vessel and nerve-fiber damage. It is commonly associated with declining thinking abilities and can progress to cognitive impairment or dementia.",
